            "sid": "NUM 3:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵamsalile Mose kuti, “Ŵanace ŵacalume wosope ŵandanda kupagwa ali ŵangune. Myoyo mwalembe mena, jwamlume jwalijose jwandanda kupagwa jwa Aisalaeli jwakwanile mwesi umo kapena kupunda. Nambo m'malo mwa jemanjajo une ngwatenda Alefi wosope ŵangune! Une ndili AMBUJE! Yilangwa yosope yandanda kupagwa ya Alefi nguyitenda soni yangu m'malo mwa yilangwa yandanda kupagwa yosope.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.40+NUM.3.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.40",
              "NUM.3.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose ŵapikanile, ni ŵalembile ŵanace wosope ŵacalume ŵandanda kupagwa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
